


REWIND(1)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            REWIND(1)



NAME
     rewind - rewind tape drive

SYNOPSIS
     rewind

DESCRIPTION
     _R_e_w_i_n_d rewinds the tape drive, if a tape is mounted on it.
     This is done by opening and closing the tape drive, using a
     file name that will rewind when the file is closed.

AUTHOR
     Mark Horton

FILES
     /dev/mt0







































